null,"created_at":"2024-06-11T12:55:21Z","label":{"name":"area/web","color":"fef2c0"},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mitmproxy/mitmproxy/issues/comments/2160715032","html_url":"https://github.com/mitmproxy/mitmproxy/issues/6909#issuecomment-2160715032","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mitmproxy/mitmproxy/issues/6909","id":2160715032,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAAfumM6AyeUY","user":{"login":"canyesilyurt","id":36952967,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2OTUyOTY3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36952967?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/canyesilyurt","html_url":"https://github.com/canyesilyurt","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/canyesilyurt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/canyesilyurt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/canyesilyurt/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/canyesilyurt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/canyesilyurt/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/canyesilyurt/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/canyesilyurt/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/canyesilyurt/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/canyesilyurt/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-06-11T13:04:01Z","updated_at":"2024-06-11T13:56:08Z","body":"I haven't checked it yet, but maybe this will solve it.\r\n\r\n```js\r\nexport function copyToClipboard(text: string): Promise<void> {\r\n    // Check if navigator.clipboard is available and if the context is secure\r\n    if (navigator.clipboard && window.isSecureContext) {\r\n        return navigator.clipboard.writeText(text).catch(err => {\r\n            console.error('Failed to copy using navigator.clipboard:', err);\r\n            // Fallback to execCommand in case of an error\r\n            return fallbackCopyToClipboard(text);\r\n        });\r\n    } else {\r\n        // Fallback for Safari and other browsers\r\n        return fallbackCopyToClipboard(text);\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction fallbackCopyToClipboard(text: string): Promise<void> {\r\n    let t = document.createElement(\"textarea\");\r\n    t.value = text;\r\n    t.style.position = \"absolute\";\r\n    t.style.opacity = \"0\";\r\n    t.style.left = \"-9999px\";\r\n    document.body.appendChild(t);\r\n\r\n    return new Promise((resolve, reject) => {\r\n        try {\r\n            t.focus();\r\n            t.select();\r\n            if (document.execCommand(\"copy\")) {\r\n                resolve();\r\n            } else {\r\n                reject(new Error(\"Copy command was unsuccessful\"));\r\n            }\r\n        } catch (err) {\r\n            console.error('Fallback: Oops, unable to copy', err);\r\n            reject(err);\r\n        } finally {\r\n            t.remove();\r\n        }\r\n    });\r\n}\r\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mitmproxy/mitmproxy/issues/comments/2160715032/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"canyesilyurt","id":36952967,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2OTUyOTY3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36952967?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/canyesilyurt","html_url":"https://github.com/canyesilyurt","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/canyesilyurt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/canyesilyurt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/canyesilyurt/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/canyesilyurt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/canyesilyurt/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/canyesilyurt/orgs","repos