,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhils/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhils/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhils/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhils/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhils/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhils/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mitmproxy/mitmproxy/issues/comments/2161300866","html_url":"https://github.com/mitmproxy/mitmproxy/issues/6909#issuecomment-2161300866","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mitmproxy/mitmproxy/issues/6909","id":2161300866,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAAfumM6A0tWC","user":{"login":"canyesilyurt","id":36952967,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2OTUyOTY3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36952967?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/canyesilyurt","html_url":"https://github.com/canyesilyurt","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/canyesilyurt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/canyesilyurt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/canyesilyurt/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/canyesilyurt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/canyesilyurt/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/canyesilyurt/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/canyesilyurt/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/canyesilyurt/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/canyesilyurt/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-06-11T17:44:41Z","updated_at":"2024-06-11T17:46:59Z","body":"It is very interesting that I could not solve this problem in safari. I had this idea and I implemented it. In all browsers that support it, the code is copied automatically. For Safari it is shown as a alert.\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/mitmproxy/mitmproxy/assets/36952967/3646f7da-1b50-4d1c-92fb-cae3411d51f8)\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n```js\r\nexport function copyToClipboard(text: string): Promise<void> {\r\n    // navigator clipboard requires a security context such as https\r\n    if (navigator.clipboard && window.isSecureContext) {\r\n        return navigator.clipboard.writeText(text).catch(err => {\r\n            console.error(\"Navigator clipboard failed:\", err);\r\n            return fallbackCopyTextToClipboard(text);\r\n        });\r\n    } else {\r\n        return fallbackCopyTextToClipboard(text);\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction fallbackCopyTextToClipboard(text: string): Promise<void> {\r\n    return new Promise((resolve, reject) => {\r\n        const textArea = document.createElement(\"textarea\");\r\n        textArea.value = text;\r\n        \r\n        // Ensure textarea is not visible and doesn't scroll the page\r\n        textArea.style.position = \"fixed\"; // or absolute\r\n        textArea.style.top = \"0\";\r\n        textArea.style.left = \"0\";\r\n        textArea.style.width = \"2em\";\r\n        textArea.style.height = \"2em\";\r\n        textArea.style.padding = \"0\";\r\n        textArea.style.border = \"none\";\r\n        textArea.style.outline = \"none\";\r\n        textArea.style.boxShadow = \"none\";\r\n        textArea.style.background = \"transparent\";\r\n        \r\n        document.body.appendChild(textArea);\r\n        textArea.focus();\r\n        textArea.select();\r\n\r\n        try {\r\n            const successful = document.execCommand('copy');\r\n            if (successful) {\r\n                resolve();\r\n            } else {\r\n                console.error(\"Fallback copy was unsuccessful\");\r\n                alert(text);\r\n                reject(new Error('Fallback copy failed'));\r\n            }\r\n        } catch (err) {\r\n            console.error(\"Fallback copy error:\", err);\r\n            alert(text);\r\n            reject(err);\r\n        } finally {\r\n            textArea.remove();\r\n        }\r\n    });\r\n}\r\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mitmproxy/mitmproxy/issues/comments/2161300866/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"canyesilyurt","id":36952967,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2OTUyOTY3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36952967?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/canyesilyurt","html_url":"https://github.com/canyesilyurt","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/canyesilyurt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/canyesilyurt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/canyesilyurt/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/canyesilyurt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/canyesilyurt/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/canyesilyurt/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/canyesilyurt/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/canyesilyurt/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/canyesilyurt/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":13130621618,"node_id":"REFE_lADOAAfumM6L2aInzwAAAAMOpWKy","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mitmproxy/mitmproxy/issues/events/13130621618","actor":{"login":"mhils","id":1019198,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTkxOTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1019198?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhils","html_url":"https://github.com/mhils","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhils/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhils/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhils